                  "body": "Yes, this is a workaround. That fix belongs in flashinfer. The platform check is also semantically correct: has_flashinfer_trtllm_fused_moe() should return False on aarch64 because the kernels don't run there. And once flashinfer does gate its trtllm modules on architecture, this guard costs nothing to keep as a defensive layer.",
